    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75240" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρνῑθο-λόχος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρνῑχ-</span></b> , ὁ<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽλοχάὠ</span>”
				<i>bird-catcher, fowler,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					1.48
				</span></i>
			, which passage is cited with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρνιθολόχῳ</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.473a
			</span></i>, but with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρνιθολόγῳ</span>
			(wrongly) in ib.<i><span class="en">
				406c
			</span></i>.</div>
